# Day 6

Today I am learning about Prefill and decode

So when we give the llm prompt at that time the response is generated slowly i.e it does not generates the whole answer in a sec but in parts 

This is because first the prefill is done i.e the llm takes the prompt and analize the what are the main pints and the values. 
It is done with the help of KV cache method( which stores the recent information or the recent tokens ).

The issue is that it does predict and tell the value of tokens but does not predict the token of the response so here Decde is use
As in decde the tokens are generated one by one and get chained to the previous one.

In Prefill the all the token are taken in one go but in decode it takes the token one by one and then answer.

